WhatsMyLLM and ModelTrace fingerprint data
==========================================

The model identification feature bundles WhatsMyLLM's versioned v2026.09.5
fingerprint bank, challenge prompts, input gates, and verdict thresholds. The
source URLs and SHA-256 checksums are recorded in internal/modelid/README.md.
The scoring implementation in internal/modelid/modelid.go is a Go port of the
public WhatsMyLLM browser implementation and credits WhatsMyLLM's own input
gates, verdict and collected fingerprints:

  https://whatsmyllm.com/
  https://whatsmyllm.com/methodology/

WhatsMyLLM credits the fingerprint method, scoring core, challenge templates
and 16 inherited bank entries to ModelTrace by xqy2006. ModelTrace is
licensed under the MIT License:

  https://github.com/xqy2006/ModelTrace

