Mihomo v1.19.32
================

The account-egress and optional Shadowsocks egress images build Mihomo v1.19.32
from upstream commit 88dcbf7f1614a67c3b36b848ee3592dfa92ada36 with reviewed
dependency security updates and the repository's locked Go toolchain. Source
provenance is recorded in deploy/shadowsocks/upstream/source.lock.env; build.sh
and mihomo-v1.19.32-dependencies.patch in that directory reproduce the binary.
The dependency updates include klauspost/compress v1.18.7, golang.org/x/crypto
v0.58.0, golang.org/x/net v0.62.0 and golang.org/x/text v0.43.0. The official
image pinned in deploy/images.lock.env is used only as a synthetic test server;
its precompiled binary is not shipped in these application images.
Upstream source:

  https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/tree/v1.19.32

Mihomo is licensed under GNU GPL version 3. The exact upstream license is
included at deploy/shadowsocks/upstream/LICENSE and installed in the image at
/usr/share/licenses/mihomo/LICENSE. The gateway application and the separate
account-egress and ss-egress startup helpers do not link to Mihomo.
